Modifications by CharOfString <root@charofstring.cc>:
- Renamed the CLI and npm package to support installation alongside Gemini CLI.
- Added named provider accounts, credential storage, selection and setup UI.
- Adapted Qwen provider preset data to Hachimi's account and model types,
  preserving endpoint choices and selected chat-model metadata while omitting
  dedicated image-generation routes.
- Added protocol adapters and integrated model/context selection with the CLI.
- Added a global LANGUAGE_PREFERENCE.md response-language preference that is
  read at session start and overridden with English on the Linux virtual console.
- Added the /effort command and model.reasoningEffort setting, mapping a unified
  effort ladder onto provider reasoning_effort and Gemini thinking settings.
- Updated tests, documentation, source formatting and distribution notices.

